xtras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.poster.avif?t=1756916526\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.webm?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.mp4?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build your warehouse </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct small storage units to organize your items and set up shelves. How about a little cart or a box? No problem for a few credits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.poster.avif?t=1756916526\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.webm?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.mp4?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Earn your vacation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Isle awaits you, and all your robot friends. Earn enough money for your well-deserved break on The Isle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.poster.avif?t=1756916526\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.webm?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.mp4?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover the secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden places in your neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.poster.avif?t=1756916526\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.webm?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.mp4?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 Meet your customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know new and exciting characters over time and see what they\u2019ll bring you! Some of our characters are even created by the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.poster.avif?t=1756916526\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.webm?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.mp4?t=1756916526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Two Pixels UG"],"dlc":[3960020],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descrip